    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island made of candy sounds like paradise \u2013 but for the residents of Sarkara, fabled to be the home of the legendary Serenity Sweet, devastating earthquakes are threatening the resident\u2019s idyllic way of life!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what\u2019s threatening the island \u2013 and all of reality as we know it \u2013 in this rollicking yarn, a 3D narrative RPG where people are objects and candy is currency.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Dress up in found objects. Reinvent yourself! ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any item, from a doll\u2019s lost arm to a floaty feather, can change how you move and talk and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Make friends with weirdos ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in local politics \u2013 or maybe accidentally join a cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/490455f37a765a143924e7b9f6ff3110.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/490455f37a765a143924e7b9f6ff3110.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/490455f37a765a143924e7b9f6ff3110.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Get into various altercations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different limbs grant special moves to sway conflict in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/bfb3b9ce083632ca11d9bebcc40c71e6.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/bfb3b9ce083632ca11d9bebcc40c71e6.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/bfb3b9ce083632ca11d9bebcc40c71e6.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Roll through some delicious sweet locations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you uncover while exploring Sarkara Island, the more mysteries you unlock: what\u2019s causing the devastating earthquakes? Who is the other O.H.N.O. official that has been sent to the island? And could the mythical Serenity Sweet, which everyone claims can make your dreams come true, really be somewhere on the island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/0291a852d6398cf6f1d572768edf8f36.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/0291a852d6398cf6f1d572768edf8f36.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/0291a852d6398cf6f1d572768edf8f36.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island made of candy sounds like paradise \u2013 but for the residents of Sarkara, fabled to be the home of the legendary Serenity Sweet, devastating earthquakes are threatening the resident\u2019s idyllic way of life!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what\u2019s threatening the island \u2013 and all of reality as we know it \u2013 in this rollicking yarn, a 3D narrative RPG where people are objects and candy is currency.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Dress up in found objects. Reinvent yourself! ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any item, from a doll\u2019s lost arm to a floaty feather, can change how you move and talk and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/07b34ab87ef7b902431c9aa1f95df3ac.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Make friends with weirdos ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in local politics \u2013 or maybe accidentally join a cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/490455f37a765a143924e7b9f6ff3110.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/490455f37a765a143924e7b9f6ff3110.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/490455f37a765a143924e7b9f6ff3110.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Get into various altercations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different limbs grant special moves to sway conflict in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/bfb3b9ce083632ca11d9bebcc40c71e6.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/bfb3b9ce083632ca11d9bebcc40c71e6.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/bfb3b9ce083632ca11d9bebcc40c71e6.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ~ ~\u00a0Roll through some delicious sweet locations ~ ~\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you uncover while exploring Sarkara Island, the more mysteries you unlock: what\u2019s causing the devastating earthquakes? Who is the other O.H.N.O. official that has been sent to the island? And could the mythical Serenity Sweet, which everyone claims can make your dreams come true, really be somewhere on the island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/0291a852d6398cf6f1d572768edf8f36.poster.avif?t=1744261131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/0291a852d6398cf6f1d572768edf8f36.webm?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269360/extras/0291a852d6398cf6f1d572768edf8f36.mp4?t=1744261131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
